    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Open index.html to view the sample code and search interface.\r\n- Identify a section ID in the provided HTML code block, like `mainHeader`.\r\n- Type the section ID into the \"Search for ID\" input field.\r\n- Click the \"Find Line\" button to see the line number and the corresponding line of code.\r\n- Practice by searching for different section IDs like `featuredContent` or `pageFooter`.",
